  "issue": "A money library's routine `EqualSplit.split` divides an amount in cents into `n` nearly equal shares. For a negative amount whose division leaves a remainder it fails instead of returning shares: splitting -101 cents four ways panics with an index out of range. This is `Money.Split` of Rhymond/go-money 1.0.3, fixed in https://github.com/Rhymond/go-money/pull/94.",
